 \section{Advantages and Disadvantages}
 Based on previous work in quantum encryption, many methods have been introduced to encrypt different types of images. However, they share two main disadvantages. First, each model is designed to encrypt only one specific QIR model and cannot be applied to others. Second, most models combine classical and quantum components.
